agement, direct and indirect procurement, logistics, field, aftermarket support, and engineering services. It offers digital operations, data-tech-AI, advisory, agent technology; and finance and accounting, human resources, sales and commercial operations, marketing, and global business solutions. The company has strategic alliance with Google Cloud. The company was founded in 1997 and is based in Hamilton, Bermuda.","employees":141000,"website":"https://www.genpact.com","country":"Bermuda","city":"Hamilton","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Balkrishan  Kalra","title":"CEO, President & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Piyush  Mehta","title":"Senior VP, Chief HR Officer & Country Manager of India"},{"name":"Ms. Riju  Vashisht","title":"SVP, Chief Growth Officer, Global Business Leader of Enterprise and Partnerships & Alliances"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":17.92,"tpe":31.96,"ps":4.757,"pfcf":27.69,"peg":1.155,"pb":5.077,"ev_ebitda":20.02,"rev_growth":0.177,"eps_growth":0.339,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2255,"eps_growth_next":0.1929,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1195,"roa":0.04674,"de":32.62,"gross_margin":0.5331,"op_margin":0.1128,"profit_margin":0.08604,"current_ratio":1.798},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":8.586,"sector":17.92,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":11.52,"sector":31.96,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":1.234,"sector":4.757,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":13.51,"sector":27.69,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.16,"sector":1.155,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":2.498,"sector":5.077,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":54.31,"sector":32.62,"verdict":"High debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.071,"sector":0.177,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":0.147,"sector":0.339,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth_fwd","label":"EPS growth (this year, est.)","v":0.129